WEBVTT

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.350
In the first round of the district matches,

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:10.650
we, the Momoyama Predators, had terrible teamwork in the first half and had a tough time.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:13.130
But during the second half,

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:15.450
goals came raining down{ unlike the first half},

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.990
and we won by a large margin.

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:23.660
Coach Hanashima told us to play the soccer we want to play, and the results show that.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:29.750
Our next opponents are Tsubakimori SC, captained by the intense Suguro-kun.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:38.140
Was Tsubakimori SC this strong?

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:39.890
They had the skill.

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:45.650
Ever since Suguro-kun became the core of their team, they got their attacking pattern down pat.{Suguro-kun became the core of the team and asserted the offense.}

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:47.560
Looks like it'll be a lot tougher than the first match.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:53.570
"You're next," huh?

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.290
How naive.

00:00:55.290 --> 00:01:00.030
Well, let's show them the difference in skill.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:45.180
I won't lose!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:48.690
All right. I'm done with the preparations.

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:52.050
There's an interesting old man in the stands, so I'm going there.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:53.050
Okay.

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:55.440
Later. Do your best!

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:57.650
Interesting old man?

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:02.940
I didn't think we'd meet in the second round.

00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:06.240
Looks like Tsubakimori's luck ran out.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:08.560
That's my line.

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:12.390
You needed girls to meet the 
requirement of minimum of eleven players.

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:14.920
Looks like your team will disappear here.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.790
Our team has the Furuya triplets.

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:22.270
I don't think we'd lose to a team with only Suguro.

00:03:22.270 --> 00:03:23.850
What are you saying?

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:27.790
I heard that those triplets were recently playing tennis.

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.090
They won't be as effective as last year.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:32.430
Don't force your luck.

00:03:32.430 --> 00:03:36.680
Just look. We won our first match 9-1.

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:38.860
That's because you played a weak team.

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.920
They scored one on you, didn't they?

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:45.150
We won 5-0. A shutout.

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:49.760
I'm gold and you're only silver. 
How dare you talk so big?{much smack?}

00:03:49.760 --> 00:03:52.330
Gold? You're more like an idiot!

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:54.850
Idiot? You're just a blockhead!

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:57.670
Huh? Look who's talking! Have a look at that raccoon face of yours!

00:03:57.670 --> 00:03:59.160
Take a look!

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.380
We've got a beautiful lady on our bench!

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.950
She's the secretary I hired.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:06.390
Hi~

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:10.360
Hmph! You probably got her from some bar you visit.

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:11.540
What did you say!?

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:16.020
Our secretary, Naomi-kun, is the real deal.

00:04:16.020 --> 00:04:21.110
Hmph. You've always liked only those types.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:22.770
W-What!?

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:24.150
I can't take this anymore!

00:04:24.150 --> 00:04:25.380
Wanna fight!?

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:26.120
Oh!

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:31.800
Enough of that, you two!

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:33.210
There are kids here!

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:35.700
S-Sorry.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.330
They're arguing like kids.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.710
Well, they're business rivals.

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:48.600
I heard it all started in elementary school when they went for the same girl.

00:04:48.600 --> 00:04:50.930
What? How cliched.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:54.170
But they can't serve as our role models at all.

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:58.960
What should I do? My heart won't stop pounding.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:13.900
I'll be fine.

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:16.250
I practiced a lot.

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:21.910
Bow!

00:05:21.910 --> 00:05:24.380
Let's have a fair match!{Thank you very much!}

00:05:31.140 --> 00:05:38.260
I definitely won't lose to you guys today!

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:40.150
W-Why're you getting so hyped up!?

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:46.340
Jeez, is he a gorilla?

00:05:46.340 --> 00:05:47.450
Right?

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:01.920
Captain. Let's form a circle.

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:05.110
What are you saying?

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:07.380
Read the atmosphere. The atmosphere.

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.760
Right, Captain?

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.010
Gather around, everyone!

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:17.140
Tsubakimori's the toughest team in the district tournament!

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:21.980
Play your hearts out like it's the finals!

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:27.150
We won't lose! Momoyama Predators!

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:28.970
Fight!

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:30.410
Oh!

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:34.280
Don't you dare lose to them!

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:39.370
Don't think this will go like last year.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:41.110
Go!

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:43.040
Fight, Onii-chan!

00:07:12.810 --> 00:07:14.130
Crap!

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:16.410
But we got the corner kick.

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:22.370
Ryuuji-kun, don't mind, don't mind!

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.670
Kota first, huh?

00:07:32.050 --> 00:07:33.260
Got it!

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:35.890
Nope!

00:07:37.510 --> 00:07:38.640
Oh no!

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:41.100
Everyone! Defense!

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.480
Be careful!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.900
Okay! Take care of him!

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:00.690
Oh no!

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:02.040
W-What?

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:05.420
There's space in front of the goal now!

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:17.220
C-Crap.

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:20.430
How's that!? My Suguro Special!

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:27.200
What Suguro Special? That was just a simple shot.

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:30.710
Suguro-kun's different from usual today.

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:34.160
Be sure to mark him when they're on offense.

00:08:34.160 --> 00:08:36.990
Okay. I can't let him go buck wild anymore.

00:08:36.990 --> 00:08:39.450
Don't mind! Don't mind!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:42.860
That #4 player is wonderful!

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:45.560
The Predators don't have a player like him.

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:48.420
He's just like Masaru-chan in the past!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:53.970
Coach Hanashima!

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:56.430
The match just started.

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:08.730
Come on.

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:10.250
Interesting.

00:09:08.730 --> 00:09:10.250
Pass it back, Kota!

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:11.530
Let's go!

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:12.990
He's goading you!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.020
No way I'm letting you pass!

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:25.880
He's the type of player that can turn his emotions into power.

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:27.930
It's really interesting.

00:09:27.930 --> 00:09:31.380
"I can't lose to the Furuyas!" Something like that?

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:34.550
Got it!

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.520
Damn!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:46.890
Kota! Calm down!

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:12.420
That fool! Not again!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.150
Go! Go!

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:25.680
I must become a wall!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:32.820
I won't let you shoot!

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.870
I must clear it!

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.710
Yes! Penalty kick!

00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:58.250
A-Are you okay?

00:10:58.250 --> 00:10:59.560
Y-Yeah.

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:27.860
Hey, Mom, what does that yellow card mean?

00:11:27.860 --> 00:11:34.460
A yellow card comes out when a player does a violent foul.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:39.800
It's a warning to the offending player.

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:45.160
If a player gets two yellow cards in a match, he's out of the game.

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:50.310
That means the two yellows become a red and he can't play in the game anymore.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.690
Eh!?

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:55.290
Then, Onii-chan will be out of the game if he gets another yellow card?

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:57.000
Seems like it.

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.780
Oh no...

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:15.610
Yes!

00:12:18.130 --> 00:12:19.810
It's my fault...

00:12:19.810 --> 00:12:20.900
Hey!

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:24.880
You just got unlucky. Don't worry about it.

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:27.010
More importantly... you!

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:27.820
More importantly... you!

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:31.830
Why did you let him pass so easily!?

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:34.380
You weren't a wall at all!

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:37.650
Reika-chan's doing her best!

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:39.690
I think so, too.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:43.980
She delayed the counterattacking cross by a little bit.

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:45.700
On the other hand...

00:12:45.700 --> 00:12:47.360
Kota-kun.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:51.580
Don't think only about scoring.

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.080
Pay more attention to our defense.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:13:00.200
Reika-chan, we can't lose!

00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:00.990
All right!

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:02.680
Got it?

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:03.470
Yeah.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:06.390
Okay.

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:09.300
Kota! What are you doing!?

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:12.180
Coach Hanashima!

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:13.820
Here, Gin-chan. {Gin = Silver}

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:16.650
Too easy.

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:21.550
We must win! Do anything to win!

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:22.650
Okay.

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:33.830
We must get back into this game.

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:36.040
Ryuuji-kun's free!

00:13:36.680 --> 00:13:38.290
Shou!

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:44.920
Crap!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:49.590
That was too hasty of a pass. Even I can see that.

00:13:49.590 --> 00:13:52.810
Is Onii-chan rushing because of his mistake?

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:55.770
That's not like him.

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:09.320
You've only got one trick up your sleeve. I can't let you keep on scoring at will.

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:11.950
Really?

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:13.620
What!?

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.080
The other side!

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:22.170
Suguro Special doesn't only come from the left!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:28.130
I-It's coming!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:30.050
Shou-kun!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:30.050
Shou!

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:37.430
C-Crap! I-I need to stop him!

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.850
But I already got a yellow...

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:42.110
But...

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:49.590
Hehe! Got it!

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:01.230
Nice save!

00:15:01.230 --> 00:15:03.210
That was thanks to you, Saionji-san.

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:10.010
Yeah! You messed up his shot!

00:15:11.280 --> 00:15:14.720
I... I did it!

00:15:14.720 --> 00:15:16.400
Nice play!

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:18.180
Yeah!

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:22.810
Hey, Shou!

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:24.400
What are you doing!?

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.110
Get your act together!

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:28.780
S-Sorry.

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:32.690
Ouzou-kun, we'll have to play with four defenders.

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:36.280
Yeah. We can't let Suguro run free anymore.

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:42.830
What's wrong with Shou-kun?

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:47.830
He's gotten caught up in the mud.

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:51.410
This match is completely different from the first one.

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:55.970
How will this match continue? I'm looking forward to it.

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:59.870
Soccer is truly interesting.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:16.370
Crap!

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:19.950
Let's go!

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:23.200
Don't lose possession that easily!

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:26.540
Ouzou is moving back to defense since Shou's not doing too well.

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:29.720
The formation is now 4-4-2.

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:33.760
We can't help it if we don't have enough players up front.

00:16:34.980 --> 00:16:36.100
They're coming.

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:37.680
O-Okay.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:51.940
That was close!

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:59.910
The first half is finally over.

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.560
Suguro! Good job!

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:09.870
Keep it up during the second half!

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:13.260
Yeah! I won't lose to the Furuyas!

00:17:21.610 --> 00:17:24.060
You're doing great, Saionji.

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:26.210
Eh? Really?

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:29.380
Reika-chan's doing her best!

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:31.440
Sorry, everyone.

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:34.040
Both goals were my fault.

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:37.410
I'm... really sorry.

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:41.980
Even if you apologize, that won't change anything.

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:44.170
Shou, learn from Ryuuji a bit.

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:44.790
Hmm?

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:49.960
He's missed so many shots, but he still keeps on shooting.

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:52.460
How rude.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:56.050
I get really upset, too.

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:00.050
Forget about the first half, Shou.

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:03.650
W-What!? Forget about the first half!?

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:07.570
What's with this dog!?

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:11.610
Zach, nice job.

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:16.240
Okay, everyone. What do the Predators lack right now?

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:18.690
I don't really want to say this,

00:18:18.690 --> 00:18:23.490
but we lack Suguro-kun's intense drive and guts to win.

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:25.830
Correct. Anything else?

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:28.540
Shou's captaincy.{Shou's skills as Captain.}

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:33.460
Kota-kun.

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:39.390
Hey, Kota-kun! Read the mood!

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:39.390
No, Kota is right.

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:40.720
Shou!

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.970
Why do you think I made you captain?

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:49.410
Well, because I gathered everyone here?

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:50.970
Not just that.

00:18:51.940 --> 00:18:53.880
Because his voice is loud?

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.530
That's true, too.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:19:00.280
He has good field vision and great defensive positioning.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.540
That's exactly right.

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:08.060
Don't get scared just because of a yellow card! That's very unlike you.

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:12.430
Saionji improved a lot, right?

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.020
Thank you very much.

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:20.720
Oh yeah, we didn't hear your voice at all during the first half.

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.360
That's right.

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:27.180
What happened to the booming voice from the yakiniku restaurant?

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:31.770
I think having a loud voice fits you more, Shou-kun.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:38.600
Everyone...

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:50.320
See? Even Zach is cheering you on.

00:19:50.320 --> 00:19:52.070
Thank you, Zach.

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:00.760
We've done well up until now.

00:20:00.760 --> 00:20:04.970
The Predators will come at us with all they've got to even the score.

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:08.960
That's when we can counterattack!

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:10.550
Let's go!

00:20:10.550 --> 00:20:11.940
Yeah!

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:16.460
If we lose this match, Coach Hanashima will be fired.

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:20.060
I didn't want to use our tactics before the real tournament, but...

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:23.300
Yoi, Big Tri, and Build, right?

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:26.910
That's right! Remember our training, everyone!

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:29.720
You're finally back to being the normal Shou.

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:33.260
After we get the ball back, make sure you use that loud voice and give us orders.

00:20:33.260 --> 00:20:34.170
Captain.

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:35.880
Okay.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:38.820
Everyone, we'll definitely turn this around!

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:40.300
Oh!

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:42.010
Good.

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:45.050
Masaru-chan, looks like they'll do great during the second half.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.100
Yeah.

00:20:46.100 --> 00:20:50.780
Coach Hanashima! If you lose this match...

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:55.230
Zach, good job.

00:20:56.470 --> 00:20:59.230
We'll cheer you on from the stands.

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:00.340
Okay!

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:07.270
Jeez, where are her manners? How dare she bring a dog to cheer us on?

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:12.290
Please do your best.

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:20.760
Let us show you the complete form of the Suguro Special.

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:23.880
You damn triplets. You're going down!

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:28.190
We'll go back to 3-5-2 during the second half.

00:21:28.190 --> 00:21:29.180
Okay.

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.500
Shou-kun looks okay now.

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:34.600
Yeah.

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:42.190
I won't fall for the same thing twice!

00:21:43.230 --> 00:21:43.900
What!?

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:50.870
Fall back!

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:54.220
He's using both sides quite effectively to attack.

00:21:54.220 --> 00:21:55.080
Good job.

00:21:56.500 --> 00:22:00.040
This is the complete version of the Suguro Special!

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:11.350
Shou-kun!

00:22:13.500 --> 00:22:14.890
Ouzou-kun!

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:22.570
Damn!{Shit!}

00:22:24.520 --> 00:22:26.030
Build!

00:22:27.740 --> 00:22:30.240
Pass it to Ushimura-kun!

00:22:30.240 --> 00:22:32.950
Yes, yes, Captain!

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:39.040
Left side!

00:22:45.160 --> 00:22:46.760
To Kota-kun!

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:49.550
That's the way, Captain.

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:55.850
Go!

00:22:58.310 --> 00:23:00.230
Time for counterattack!

00:23:02.700 --> 00:23:05.950
The Predators are now going after their prey.

00:24:35.510 --> 00:24:36.820
Time for counterattack!

